<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 119-7 AT TEA V INDIA IN FIRST TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 119-7 AT TEA V INDIA IN FIRST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>AHMEDABAD, India 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa, replying</p>
<p>to India's first innings score of 223, were 119 for seven at tea</p>
<p>on the second day of the first test on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 223. South Africa 119-7.</p>
</text>
